        <body>
            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0800" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg740"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Señor Benitez to Mr.
                        Washburn.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of State for Foreign
                                Affairs,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Luque,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-07-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 13, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Again called upon by the judicial authorities, I beg your excellency will excuse
                    me for molesting you once more, to request you to dismiss from your hotel the
                    North American citizen Porter Cornelius Bliss, and the British subject George
                    Masterman, accused of crimes not less grave than the others whose dismissal I
                    have already had the honor to request.</p>
                <p>I embrace this occasion to renew to your excellency the assurances of my
                    distinguished consideration and esteem.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GUMESINDO BENITEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles A. Washburn</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States of
                            America.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
